          "category": "ancestry",
          "description": {
            "value": "<p><strong>Trigger</strong> You fail or critically fail a Will save against an emotion effect.</p><hr /><p>Even in the face of overwhelming tribulation, you find solace in the notion that this feeling is fleeting; all things are merely part of a never-ending cycle. Reroll the triggering saving throw with a +1 status bonus. You must use the second result, even if it's worse.</p>"
          },
          "frequency": {
            "max": 1,
            "per": "day"
          },
